0..71 Comment "//! A monad relative to the shift `-F`: a unit returning a value and an"
72..145 Comment "//! extension running a computation into a continuation, over a family of"
146..221 Comment "//! computation types [Altenkirch-2015-monads_need_not_be_endofunctors] and"
222..302 Comment "//! [Jiang-2025-notions_stackmanipulating_computation_relative_monads]. Its host"
303..381 Comment "//! half is ordinary definitions: the option monad\'s two operations, a program"
382..459 Comment "//! sequenced through them, and code polymorphic in the carrier. Of the laws,"
460..533 Comment "//! the left unit is a second-order rule and the right unit abstracts the"
534..609 Comment "//! variable the continuation binds; associativity overlaps itself and both"
610..671 Comment "//! units, and every pair joins, so the three are one theory."
672..675 Comment "//!"
676..713 Comment "//! - see: #2115 — `MonadRightUnit`"
714..750 Comment "//! - see: #2116 — `RelativeMonad`"
751..813 Comment "//! - cites: [Altenkirch-2015-monads_need_not_be_endofunctors]"
